      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk im just really scared to go to the er if it's not serious... my doctor said i have a history of complex migraines and usually when i get the aura it feels exactly like this. do you think it could just be a particularly bad flare up? i have some sumatriptan here, should i just take a dose of that and wait it out in a dark room?",
